WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.682
T-Shirt Showdown is a creative game for three to ten people. You'll draw, write, and design shirts, and then fight over whose is best.

2
00:00:10.382 --> 00:00:16.798
First, you get a prompt. Draw a picture for it, and then write a short slogan. You'll do this a few times.

3
00:00:16.948 --> 00:00:26.045
Then comes the mixing. Everyone's drawings and slogans go into a pool, and you can combine any of them, choose a colour, and make your shirts.

4
00:00:26.745 --> 00:00:31.588
Shirts are paired up in head-to-head battles, and everyone who isn't in the battle votes.

5
00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:41.598
Each vote is worth a hundred points, plus a hundred for the win. If you made the shirt, you get the points. And the artist and the slogan writer each get half.

6
00:00:42.298 --> 00:00:48.979
The strangest combinations are usually the funniest. And keep slogans short, so they're easy to read.
